OL,3,CThree people from same family die
OL,4,Cafter getting into trouble off Sussex
OL,5,Ccoast
OL,7,FA couple and their teenage daughter
OL,8,Fhave died after getting into
OL,9,Fdifficulty off the Sussex coast.
OL,11,FMultiple ambulances and two air
OL,12,Fambulances were seen in Shoreham-by-
OL,13,FSea, West Sussex, near the RNLI
OL,14,Fstation on Tuesday afternoon.
OL,16,FSussex Police confirmed emergency
OL,17,Fservices were responding to four
OL,18,Fpeople getting into difficulty in the
OL,19,Fwater close to Shoreham Fort.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
