OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787100480
OL,3,CThree people from same family die
OL,4,Cafter getting into trouble off Sussex
OL,5,Ccoast
OL,7,FThe force believe the family entered
OL,8,Fthe water from land for a swim.
OL,10,FSpeaking to reporters, Chief
OL,11,FSuperintendent James Collis said a
OL,12,Fman, a woman and a teenage girl died,
OL,13,Fwhile a younger girl from the same
OL,14,Ffamily is in a critical condition in
OL,15,Fhospital.
OL,17,FHe said: "Around 2.40 pm this
OL,18,Fafternoon, emergency services were
OL,19,Fcalled to reports of four people in
OL,20,Fdifficulty in the water close to
OL,21,FShoreham Fort.
OL,26,@yD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
