PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787100480
OL,3,CThree people from same family die
OL,4,Cafter getting into trouble off Sussex
OL,5,Ccoast
OL,7,F"Sussex Police supported His Majesty's
OL,8,FCoast Guard and the RNLI as all four
OL,9,Fpeople were brought to shore.
OL,11,F"Tragically, despite the best efforts
OL,12,Fof paramedics, three people ` a man, a
OL,13,Fwoman, and a teenage girl ` were sadly
OL,14,Fconfirmed deceased.
OL,16,F"A younger girl has been taken to
OL,17,Fhospital and is in critical condition.
OL,18,FWe can confirm all four people were
OL,19,Ffrom the same family, and their next
OL,20,Fof kin have been informed."
