OL,3,CThree people from same family die
OL,4,Cafter getting into trouble off Sussex
OL,5,Ccoast
OL,7,FSpecialist officers are supporting the
OL,8,Ffamily's next of kin.
OL,10,FFollowing the incident, the A259
OL,11,FBrighton Road was blocked in both
OL,12,Fdirections from New Road to Kingston
OL,13,FLane.
OL,15,FA HM Coastguard helicopter was sent
OL,16,Falong with rescue teams from
OL,17,FLittlehampton, Shoreham and Newhaven
OL,18,Fand an RNLI lifeboat from Shoreham.
